      <div class="view-content">
          <div class="views-row"><div class="views-field views-field-polo-fisico"><div class="field-content">Milano</div></div><div class="views-field views-field-risorse-didattica"><span class="views-label views-label-risorse-didattica field--label">Sedi didattiche</span><div class="field-content">Lecture rooms and laboratories are in the "Città Studi" campus, mostly in the University buildings of Via Celoria, 26 (Edifici Biologici); Via Celoria, 20 (Settore Didattico); Via Golgi, 19 (Edificio Golgi). The Department of Biosciences is the reference structure for all teaching activities related to the MB&amp;B course.</div></div><div class="views-field views-field-risorse-laboratori"><span class="views-label views-label-risorse-laboratori field--label">Sedi laboratori</span><div class="field-content">The MB&amp;B course is characterized by an intense laboratory activity that is mainly carried out in the internship activity for the thesis.</div></div></div>

